## The packaged binary halts from its application start, so Elixir's
## `start_cli` (which sets stdio to unicode) never runs, and the `user`
## device keeps the locale's encoding: under `LC_ALL=C` a UTF-8 frame on
## `raxol mcp`'s wire was double-encoded. prim_tty reads this when kernel
## starts, which is before any config file could set it.
-kernel standard_io_encoding unicode
